flowchart TD
    A[Consistency Models] --> B[Strong Consistency]
    A --> C[Sequential Consistency]
    A --> D[Causal Consistency]
    A --> E[Eventual Consistency]

    B --> B1["Linearizability: all nodes same order matching real time"]
    B --> B2["Implementation: W+R > N quorum"]

    C --> C1["Program order per process, global order need not match real time"]

    D --> D1["Causally related writes seen in same order"]
    D --> D2["Implementation: Vector Clocks"]

    E --> E1["Converges given no new updates"]
    E --> E2["Requires conflict resolution"]

    F[CAP Theorem] --> G["Partition -> choose C or A"]
    F --> H["PACELC: Partition A/C Else L/C"]

    I[Quorum Systems] --> J["N=5 W=3 R=3 -> W+R=6 > N=5"]
    I --> K[Read Repair]
    I --> L[Hinted Handoff]

    M[Logical Clocks] --> N[Lamport Clocks]
    M --> O[Vector Clocks]
    N --> N1["Integer counter, captures happens-before"]
    O --> O1["Per-process vector, detects concurrency"]

    P[CRDTs] --> Q[G-Counter]
    P --> R[PN-Counter]
    P --> S[OR-Set]
    Q --> Q1["Grow-only, sum across nodes"]
    R --> R1["Increment + decrement via 2 G-Counters"]
    S --> S1["Add/remove with unique tags"]

    T[Anti-Entropy] --> U[Merkle Trees]
    T --> V[Gossip Protocol SWIM]
    U --> U1["O(log N) hash exchange"]
    V --> V1["O(log N) rounds to converge"]

    W[Snapshots] --> X[Chandy-Lamport]
    X --> X1["Consistent cut via marker messages"]